cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, please cite it as below and link to https://anticsapp.com/party-data/, the canonical source."
title: "Antics party data: how groups play party games, 26 August to 4 October 2026"
type: dataset
abstract: "Anonymous shares, ratios and medians from parties played on Antics, a pass-the-phone party game app, between 26 August and 4 October 2026: when parties start (UK time), which night of the week is busiest, how many games a party plays, which game comes first, how often Truth or Dare players pick truth or dare, how often each game's cards are skipped, and how long a card stays on screen. Percentages, ratios and medians only."
